  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math></p><p>The line of sight formula for an antenna is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mi>h</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3940</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>km</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
